  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\n**1) + - × ÷**\n\n→ 13 + 64 - 2 × **8 ÷ 11** = 18\n\n→ 13 + 64 - **2 ****× 8/11** = 18\n\n→ **13 +**** 64** - 16/11 = 18\n\n→ 77 - 16/11 = 18\n\n→ 831/11 ≠ 18\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**2) × ÷ - +**\n\n→ 13 × **64 ÷ 2** - 8 + 11 = 18\n\n→ **13 × 32** - 8 + 11 = 18\n\n→ **416** - 8 **+ ****11** = 18\n\n→ 427 - 8 = 18\n\n→ 419 ≠ 18\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**3) × ÷ + -**\n\n→ 13 × **64 ÷ 2** + 8 - 11 = 18\n\n→ **13 × 32** + 8 - 11 = 18\n\n→ **416 +**** 8** - 11 = 18\n\n→ 424 - 11 = 18\n\n→ 413 ≠ 18\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**4) + × ÷ -**\n\n→ 13 + 64 × **2 ÷ 8** - 11 = 18\n\n→ 13 + **64 × 1/4** - 11 = 18\n\n→ **13 + 16** - 11 = 18\n\n→ 29 - 11 = 18\n\n→ 18 = 18\n\n→ **LHS = RHS** ⇒ **Satisfies the equation.**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 4 satisfies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"+ × ÷ -\"**.",
